==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Trumbeak|107}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
*'''Glide''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Delta Species|Swellow|32}} from the {{TCG|EX Delta Species}} expansion.
